# S All-Platforms Packages

Built artifacts under `dist/platforms/`:

| Archive | Contents |
|---------|----------|
| linux-*.tar.gz | Full tree + optional s_fast native |
| macos-universal.tar.gz | Portable Python S core |
| windows-x86_64.tar.gz | Portable + s.bat |

## Requirements
- Python 3.10+ on PATH (all platforms)
- Native Rust binary: built on Linux CI host; rebuild on Mac/Windows with cargo for accel

## Build
```bash
bash build.sh
bash scripts/package_platform.sh linux-x86_64   # or lean pack scripts
```

## Cross-compile note
This environment has no rustup/mingw/osxcross. Native binaries for Win/Mac must be built on those OSes or a full cross toolchain. Language itself is pure-Python portable.
